As you are aware, matters could not be worse right now. We are trapped on Elysium, without any access to the portal, or any ability to build reinforcements. We must retake our Recycler from the Chinese, and quickly! We will have to mount a lightning strike and seize the Recycler before the Chinese can respond with any force.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Enter the Chinese base.
- Reclaim our Recycler.
- Get your units clear of the Portal blast (minimum safe distance: 700m).

ENGINEERING REPORT:
Our men are ready for the strike. Once in the Chinese base, you can rely on them to get to the Recycler quickly and bring it back on line.